   "headline": "Four NWSL players made the 2026 Ballon d'Or Féminin shortlist",
   "summary": "The shortlist for the most prestigious award in soccer, the Ballon d'Or Féminin, was announced on September 8. The Ballon d'Or is awarded to the best player in the world for the previous season by \"France Football\" magazine, and four NWSL players made the cut.\nBarbra Banda led the nominations",
